0..73 Comment "// The twin of `model/desc/relative-monad.gandr`: the right unit, which a"
74..149 Comment "// theory cannot state yet. Associativity waits on two refusals at once, an"
150..219 Comment "// abstraction at the continuation\'s port (#2115) and its left side\'s"
220..298 Comment "// overlap with itself (#2116, `second-order-rules.gandr`\'s `LetOverlap`), and"
299..359 Comment "// is written once one expectation can name what it refuses."
361..436 Comment "/// The right unit: extending a computation by the unit is the computation."
437..512 Comment "/// `bind x . ret(x)` is an abstraction at `k`\'s port, which no rule writes"
513..529 Comment "/// yet (#2115)."
